# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a fashion student and Ladybug, I am committed to creating sustainable fashion practices. This research plan focuses on reducing waste and promoting eco-friendly materials in the fashion industry.<br>
<br>
## Reducing Textile Waste<br>
<br>
* Implement take-back programs for old clothes<br>
* Design clothing with recyclable materials<br>
* Create a clothing rental service<br>
<br>
## Promoting Eco-Friendly Materials<br>
<br>
* Use organic cotton instead of conventional cotton<br>
* Develop sustainable fabrics made from recycled plastics<br>
* Partner with suppliers who prioritize environmental sustainability<br>
<br>
## Next Steps<br>
<br>
* Conduct market research on take-back programs and clothing rental services<br>
* Meet with suppliers to discuss eco-friendly material options<br>
* Create a prototype for sustainable fabric production<br>
```<br>
